quare feet, but is discribed as pushing the Azothic Radiance outward.</div> </div> </div> </div>So in this case the power reach would be an area like a small room or an arm lenght from the promethean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-17T20:50:07-07:00","id":1312878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1222410-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-prometheans-edition?p=1312722#post1312722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So in this case the power reach would be an area like a small room or an arm lenght from the promethean?</div> </div> </div> </div>Arm's length or a general melee range.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4725-murder_of_craws","name":"Murder_of_Craws","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4725_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-18T02:33:55-07:00","id":1312911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Murder_of_Craws</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1222410-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-prometheans-edition?p=1312878#post1312878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Arm's length or a general melee range.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seems more balanced this way.<br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-24T12:13:41-07:00","id":1314130,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Did Night Horrors release a sub slat for <span style=\"color:#252c2f\">P</span>rometheans<span style=\"color:#252c2f\">?<br /> Like in the back of most 2E books, Kindred have ghouls, Werewolves have wolfblooded, Changelings have fae touched, etc. </span></span></span> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\">P</span><span style=\"color:#252c2f\">rometheans don't have one and I was wondering if Night Horrors added one.</span></span></span></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/13.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":4793,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","user":"HunterInTheNight","date":". 05-24-2019, 03:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","name":"HunterInTheNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-24T12:35:47-07:00","id":1314140,"title":"","content":"Short answer: No.<br /> <br /> Long answer: to my mind, the Promethean sub-splat would be playable alchemists. Human demiurges are also a thing, but they're not a splat: they're defined not by what they are or even what they do, but by what they <i>did</i>. These are not things to be covered in an Antagonists book; they belong in a Player's Guide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 05-24-2019, 03:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-24T12:51:45-07:00","id":1314145,"title":"","content":"Did they release a players guide for promethean 2E yet","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/13.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","name":"HunterInTheNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-24T12:58:33-07:00","id":1314149,"title":"","content":"They have not, not even announced sadly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-24T13:26:27-07:00","id":1314155,"title":"","content":"As a stopgap measure, I've worked up something of a model for how to do <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/989195-alternate-alchemist-rules\">playable alchemists</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#